To access the Ancient Cavern, one must have completed the first part of [[Barbarian Firemaking]] training and then talked to [[Otto]] about pyre ships. After the conversation is over, the player can now go in the whirlpool. Upon entering, one must climb down stairs and then run south to a set of stairs leading up to the mithril dragons. Note that [[dwarf multicannon]]s are not allowed in the Ancient Cavern.

==Attacks==
[[File:Mithril dragon attacks.webp|thumb|right|The powerful mithril dragon on the attack.]]
Mithril dragons can use all three attack styles as well as [[dragonfire]]. The dragon will pick a physical attack 60% of the time (melee if the player is in melee distance, ranged if not), and a magic attack 40% of the time. If the chosen style was ranged or magic, a 20% chance is then rolled for the attack to be replaced with a dragonfire attack.{{CiteDiscord|author=Mod Ash|url=https://discord.com/channels/324132423636090880/431834766325841920/1348574796350361630|date=10 February 2025|quote=If within melee range, it picks 60% melee & 40% magic. Otherwise it picks 60% ranged & 40% magic.
Having picked ranged or magic, it has a 20% chance of doing dragonfire instead.|image=Ash mithril dragon answer.png|ctximage=Ash mithril dragon question.png|ctxquote=@JagexAsh Do you by any chance know, or are you able to check, how Mithril Dragons pick which attack style they use? It seems they use melee, magic and dragonfire in melee range, and ranged, magic and dragonfire at longer range. I have counted attacks for about 400 melee attacks and Im seeing a ratio of roughly 5 melee attacks, 4 magic attacks and 2 dragonfire attacks every 11 attacks on average|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/27962807#chat-messages-431834766325841920-1348574796350361630|archivedate=2026-03-07}} Mithril dragons' ranged attacks are [[magical ranged]], rolling against the player's magic defence but negated by [[Protect from Missiles]]. The [[Justiciar armour]] set effect will reduce the incoming damage according to the player's '''ranged defence bonus'''.

